{"id":200,"slug":"wings-of-desire","title":"Wings of Desire","year":1987,"country":"Germany","duration":127,"spine":490,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/200-wings-of-desire","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/12b76bc360f9bc4f32f90fa0edd732ff/HRUUfXVsjmvKDOhzr9UfufiLT25yFV_large.jpg","description":"Wings of Desire is one of cinema’s loveliest city symphonies. Bruno Ganz is Damiel, an angel perched atop buildings high over Berlin who can hear the thoughts—fears, hopes, dreams—of all the people living below. But when he falls in love with a beautiful trapeze artist, he is willing to give up his immortality and come back to earth to be with her. Made not long before the fall of the Berlin Wall, this stunning tapestry of sounds and images, shot in black and white and color by the legendary Henri Alekan, forever made the name of director Wim Wenders synonymous with film art.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Wim Wenders","slug":"wim-wenders"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Bruno Ganz","role":"Damiel","slug":"bruno-ganz"},{"actor":"Solveig Dommartin","role":"Marion","slug":"solveig-dommartin"},{"actor":"Otto Sander","role":"Cassiel","slug":"otto-sander"},{"actor":"Curt Bois","role":"Homer","slug":"curt-bois"},{"actor":"Peter Falk","role":"As himself","slug":"peter-falk"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Wim Wenders","slug":"wim-wenders"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Wim Wenders","slug":"wim-wenders"},{"role":"together with","person":"Peter Handke","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producer","person":"Ingrid Windisch","slug":null},{"role":"Music by","person":"Jürgen Knieper","slug":null},{"role":"Editor","person":"Peter Przygodda","slug":null},{"role":"Assistant director","person":"Claire Denis","slug":"claire-denis"},{"role":"Art director","person":"Heidi Lüdi","slug":null},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Henri Alekan","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[{"session":920,"title":"Jodie Foster’s Closet Picks","date":"2026-01-06","vide